& [TextBudgets] count exact UTF-8 bytes
  + [identifier_bytes] is 256 for field element boundary and run identities
  + [subject_bytes] is 4096
  + [purpose_bytes] is 4096
  + [element_content_bytes] is 16384 per element
  + [source_ref_bytes] is 2048
  + [boundary_reason_bytes] is 4096
  + [provider_model_bytes] is 4096
  + [provider_base_url_bytes] is 2048
  = must: reject over-budget values without truncation normalization or inference

& [FileBudgets] constrain local allocation before deserialization
  + [semantic_field_file_bytes] is 524288
  + [cycle_report_file_bytes] is 16777216
  = must: inspect metadata and reject an oversized file before reading its body

& [ProviderBudgets] constrain each ordinary loopback call
  + [connect_timeout_seconds] is 5
  + [request_timeout_seconds] is 90
  + [response_bytes] is 1048576
  + [retry_count] is 0
  + [redirect_limit] is 0
  + [proxy_policy] is disabled
  = must: enforce the byte ceiling for declared and chunked response lengths
  = must: retain non-success HTTP status response byte count and response body SHA-256 without body content
  = must: refuse proxy routing and redirect following so validated loopback identity cannot escape after admission

& [ReplayBoundary] preserves history
  + historical request profiles 0.1 through 0.5 retain exact prompts schemas and compiler meanings
  + historical reports inside the new file and identity ceilings remain replayable
  + all budgets are exposed through contract output and verified by boundary tests

& [AuthorityBoundary] remains experimental P0
  - never: treat resource acceptance as semantic truth authorization production safety or remote-network permission

& [SatisfactionSignature] binds the bounded amendment
  @ [signature_uuid] c5e3762e-1c26-4c07-a9fb-68cfe78786c3
  @ [protocol_uuid] ad10f10f-d506-48ef-a805-f8b0a133766c
  + [satisfied_scope] is numeric host text file provider time response and failure-body evidence budgets
  + [excluded_scope] is production hardening quotas concurrency remote networking effects training and semantic quality
  = satisfaction: source-preserved justified falsifiable reversible and bounded for P0
